==English==

===Pronunciation===
* {{audio|en-us-rabble.ogg|Audio (US)}}
* {{rhymes|æbəl}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# A [[mob]]; a [[disorderly]] crowd.
# The mass of [[common]] people; the lowest class of people.

====Synonyms====
* [[riffraff]]

====Derived terms====
* [[rabble rouser]]

